'''Devin Wayne Lemons''' (born March 20, 1979) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] for the [[Washington Redskins]] of the [[National Football League]].  He was born in [[Bryan, Texas]], and played [[college football]] for the [[Texas Tech Red Raiders football|Texas Tech Red Raiders]].

Lemons now coaches football at [[Prosper High School]] in [[Prosper, Texas]].<ref>{{cite web | work=[[Coppell High School|Liberty High School]] Wrestling | url=http://www.lhsredhawkwrestling.com/About_the_Coach.html | title=Coaches Corner | accessdate=2009-02-11 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20090117081408/http://www.lhsredhawkwrestling.com/About_the_Coach.html | archive-date=2009-01-17 | url-status=dead }}</ref>
